sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor c as Contributor
  participant pr as Pull request
  participant chk as check-submission (read-only)
  participant sf as safe-fetch
  participant ep as New endpoint
  participant rep as report (write)
  c->>pr: add server line to README.md
  pr->>chk: pull_request_target: opened, edited, synchronize
  Note over chk: checks out the base branch, never PR code
  chk->>sf: probe each new endpoint (max 25)
  sf->>ep: https POST handshake, 20 s timeout
  ep-->>sf: status and headers
  chk->>rep: result JSON: labels and comments
  rep->>pr: apply allowlisted labels, post comments once per marker
